{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CftKFg8m9YY5932Cui2Eo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Not yet. Fix discoverability first, then decide.\n\n**The data points to a navigation problem, not a need for AI.** About 62% of sampled emails (roughly 185 a month) ask how to do one of two things. Both forms are three clicks deep under a vague \"Documents\" label, and the answer sits in a 40-page PDF. Employees probably can't find the answer; that doesn't mean they need a conversation.\n\n**Cheaper fixes for the same problem (days, not weeks):**\n- Put \"Request parental leave\" and \"Carry over holiday\" buttons on the portal homepage.\n- Write a one-page plain-language summary for each topic: eligibility, deadlines, steps and the form link.\n- Give HR a canned reply, or an auto-reply, that links to those pages.\n- Make the PDF searchable and split it into sections with anchors.\n\n**Risks of a chatbot here:**\n- It could misstate leave entitlements, which creates legal and employee-relations exposure.\n- One developer for four weeks can build a demo but probably not a reliable, maintained system with evaluation, citations and policy-update handling.\n- It still won't help much if the real issue is that people can't find the form.\n\n**Check before committing:**\n- Read the 62 emails. Are people asking *where* the form is, or *whether they're eligible* and how the policy applies to them? The second may need HR judgement, not a bot.\n- 100 emails is a reasonable sample, but check it isn't skewed by season (holiday carry-over clusters at year-end).\n\n**Suggested plan:** Spend week 1 on the homepage links, summaries and canned replies. Track email volume for 4–6 weeks. If many questions remain and they're varied, consider a narrow retrieval chatbot that cites the policy, using what you learned."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3194,"cache_read_input_tokens":5007,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3194},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"11eda3bd-53e1-4777-87f9-6218d2531c10","uuid":"2000a226-a401-4453-bd15-b79f7caf66c3","timestamp":"2026-10-10T09:25:15.458Z","request_id":"req_011CftKFfrQGkSFXk1MjDA6W"}
